& =(5)^{6}+6(5)^{5} x+15(5)^{4} x^{2}+20(5)^{3} x^{3}+15(5)^{2} x^{4}+6(5) x^{5}+x^{6} \\
& =15625+18750 x+9375 x^{2}+2500 x^{3}+375 x^{4}+30 x^{5}+x^{6} \\
& \left(x+\frac{a}{x}\right)^{2}=x^{2}+2 a+\frac{a^{2}}{x^{2}}
\end{aligned}
$$
1M
∵ Coefficient of $x=-90000$
$$
\therefore \quad \begin{aligned}
18750(2 a)+2500\left(a^{2}\right) & =-90000 \\
a^{2}+15 a+36 & =0 \\
(a+3)(a+12) & =0 \\
a & =\underline{\underline{-3}} \text { or } a=\underline{\underline{-12}}
\end{aligned}
$$
1M
